1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
 Whatever labels may weigh heavily upon you today, Jesus Christ can raise you above them.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:15,280
 His grace is sufficient to live to above every label and limitation.

3
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:21,080
 Before we were students, athletes, employees, parents, citizens, or leaders, we were spirit

4
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:24,040
 children of our Heavenly Father.

5
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:28,700
 That eternal identity does not change when circumstances change.

6
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:36,540
 When we make mistakes or when others misunderstand us, he loves you.

7
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:38,580
 He knows you.

8
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:43,820
 He sees you as you are now and who you will become.

9
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:51,580
 He has a plan for your life and Jesus Christ is at the center of that plan.

10
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:54,640
 and Russell M. Nelson taught us that embrace

